      en: ["The park is located in Chobhar, on the outskirts of Kathmandu.", "It features a wide array of life-sized dinosaur models.", "It is among the largest water and amusement parks in Nepal.", "The facility includes a high-tech 4D cinema theater.", "The wave pool is one of its most popular water features.", "It serves as a major hub for family entertainment and school trips."],
